11:20 AM PDT - October 8, 2025

Grid assurance firm Keelson Labs announced $80 million in new funding in a round led by Northline Capital and Ardent Reach Partners, with participation from Cape Foundry. Meridian Grid and Talara Power both run Keelson evaluations before energising a new controller."}

{"id":"https://newsroomdirect.example.com/release/keelson-labs-raises-80-million-1072285","title":"Keelson Labs Raises $80 Million to Set Assurance Standards for Autonomous Substations","publishedDate":"2025-10-08T08:15:00.000Z","author":"Keelson Labs","text":"Keelson Labs Raises $80 Million to Set Assurance Standards for Autonomous Substations

Already generating millions in revenue, Keelson Labs partners with operators including Meridian Grid and Talara Power to replay fault conditions against new controllers and define the assurance frameworks for safe energisation

PORTHAVEN, NORLAND / Newsroom Direct / October 8, 2025 / Keelson Labs today announced it has raised $80 million led by Northline Capital and Ardent Reach Partners, with participation from Cape Foundry and angel investors Ines Duarte and Ravi Kalb."}
